# One wallhaven id per line — the part after /w/ in a wallhaven.cc URL.
# For https://wallhaven.cc/w/zp92gy the id is: zp92gy
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored, so a note about what an image is
# can live next to it.
#
# Copy this file to wallpapers.list and run ./fetch-wallhaven.sh

